        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_0000066</IRI>
        <Literal>Clindamycin is a lincosamide antibiotic that blocks A-site aminoacyl-tRNA binding. It is usually used to treat infections with anaerobic bacteria but can also be used to treat some protozoal diseases, such as malaria.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
