        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_0000069</IRI>
        <Literal>Doxycycline is second generation semi-synthetic derivative of the tetracycline group of antibiotics. It inhibits bacterial protein synthesis by binding to the 30S subunit of the bacterial ribosome and preventing the aminotransferase-tRNA from associating with the ribosome.</Literal>
