        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3000006</IRI>
        <Literal>VanH is a D-specific alpha-ketoacid dehydrogenase that synthesizes D-lactate. D-lactate is incorporated into the end of the peptidoglycan subunits, decreasing vancomycin binding affinity.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
