        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3000074</IRI>
        <Literal>emrB is a translocase in the emrB -TolC efflux protein in E. coli. It recognizes substrates including carbonyl cyanide m-chlorophenylhydrazone (CCCP), nalidixic acid, and thioloactomycin.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
