        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3000324</IRI>
        <Literal>Sulfadiazine is a potent inhibitor of dihydropteroate synthase, interfering with the tetrahydrofolic biosynthesis pathway. Tetrahydrofolic acid is essential for folate synthesis, a precursor to many nucleotides and amino acids.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
