        <Literal>A category of aminoglycoside N-acetyltransferase enzymes with modification regiospecificity based at the 6&apos;-amino group of the respective antibiotic. These enzymes inactivate aminoglycoside antibiotics through acetylation of the 6-amino group of the compound.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
