        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3000453</IRI>
        <Literal>vat (Virginiamycin acetyltransferases) enzymes catalyze the transfer of an acetyl group from acetyl-CoA to the secondary alcohol of streptogramin A compounds, thus inactivating virginiamycin-like antibiotics and conferring resistance to these compounds.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
