        <AnnotationProperty IRI="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3000712</IRI>
        <Literal>Bacterial DNA and RNA synthesis includes many enzymes unique to bacteria that are targeted by antibiotics.</Literal>
