        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3000715</IRI>
        <Literal>Enzymes in this pathway generate important precursors for macromolecules. While eukaryotes and prokaryotes both synthesize isoprenoids, many bacteria and notably mycobacteria use an alternative pathway that is targeted by antibiotics.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty IRI="http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasOBONamespace"/>
