        <Literal>RlmA(II) is a methyltransferase found in Streptococcus pneumoniae and confers resistance to tylosin and mycinamicin. Specifically, this enzyme adds a methyl group to guanosine 748 (E. coli numbering) of 23S ribosomal RNA.</Literal>
