        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3001308</IRI>
        <Literal>VgbB inactivates streptogramin B-type antibiotics by linearizing the lactone ring on the ester bond through an elimination mechanism, thus conferring resistance.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
