        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3004047</IRI>
        <Literal>kdpD is a component of the two-component regulatory system, kdpDE. This system is involved in potassium transport and homeostasis, and has been implicated in virulence factor regulation along with kdpE.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
