        <Literal>PmpM is a multidrug efflux pump belonging to the MATE family of Pseudomonas aeruginosa. PmpM is an H+ drug antiporter and is the first reported case of an H+ coupled efflux pump in the MATE family. PmpM confers resistance to fluoroquinolones, fradiomycin, benzalkonium chloride, chlorhexidine gluconate, ethidium bromide, tetraphenylphosphonium chloride (TPPCl), and rhodamine 6G.</Literal>
