        <AnnotationProperty IRI="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3004154</IRI>
        <Literal>Thymidylate synthase (synthetase) catalyzes the conversion of dUMP to dTMP in the nucleic acid biosynthesis pathway. Inhibition of thyA imbalances the cellular concentration of dUMP causing DNA damage.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
