        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3004249</IRI>
        <Literal>UhpA acts as a positive regulator of UhpT, which is a transporter to bring fosfomycin drugs into bacterial cells. Mutations in UhpA that negatively impact the expression of UhpT can confer resistance.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
