        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3004250</IRI>
        <Literal>PtsI family phosphotransferases are involved in cyclic AMP synthesis, which regulates glpT expression. Mutations in PtsI family genes can negatively affect expression of UhpT, which is needed for fosfomycin import.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
