        <Literal>A category of aminoglycoside O-nucleotidyltransferase enzymes with modification regiospecificity based at the 3&apos;&apos;-hydroxyl group of the respective antibiotic. These enzymes inactivate aminoglycoside antibiotics by transfer of an AMP group from an ATP substrate to the 3&apos;&apos;-hydroxyl group of the compound.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
