        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3004280</IRI>
        <Literal>The MltA-interacting Protein (MipA) family consists mainly of homologs to MipA and OmpV proteins. Proteins of this family, are predicted to form a beta-barrel.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
