        <Literal>Qualitative description of a microbial response to antimicrobial agents and the expected clinical outcome. Bacteria may be susceptible or resistant to a broad range of antibiotic drugs or drug classes, with several intermediate states or phases.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
