        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3004367</IRI>
        <Literal>DIN is recognized by the Federal Government of Germany as the competent standards organization for Germany and as the national standards body representing Germany in non-governmental international standards organizations. Baquero F. found that the DIN system recommends lower breakpoints than the consensus standard of all systems for antimicrobial susceptibility testing used in Europe (BSAC, DIN, SFM, SIR, NCCLS and WRG).</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
