        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3004393</IRI>
        <Literal>Allows for time-dependent or concentration-dependent analysis of antimicrobial effects. Several tubes of broth culture medium containing a suspension of the test microbe are treated with varying concentrations of the antimicrobial agent and the percentage of dead cells determined at various time points.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
