        <Literal>A diarylquinoline antibiotic drug sold under the brand name Sirturo, used to treat infection from Mycobacterium spp., particularly multidrug-resistant tuberculosis. Bedaquiline disrupts ATP synthase by proton pump blockage, inhibiting ATP synthesis.</Literal>
