        <Literal>Arylamine N-acetyltransferase catalyzes the transfer of the acetyl group from acetyl coenzyme A to the free amino group of arylamines and hydrazines. Reports have shown that overexpression of this enzyme may be responsible for increased resistance to isoniazid.</Literal>
