        <Literal>Hp1165 is a homolog of the Clostridium perfringes tetP gene and is part of the MFS efflux family but is not considered a true tetracycline resistance gene. Hp1165 confers low level resistance to tetracycline, however cessation of antibiotic treatment results in the host cell reverting to susceptibility.</Literal>
