        <Literal>Antibiotic-induced changes to cell morphology, including shape, volume and surface area, which decrease antibiotic susceptibility.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty IRI="http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasOBONamespace"/>
