        <Literal>Evernimicin is a veterinary oligosaccharide antibiotic of the orthosomycin group of orthoester antibiotics. Along with avilamycin, it exhibits activity against a variety of Gram-positive and -negative bacteria and is primarily used in livestock feed.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
