        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3007174</IRI>
        <Literal>Scutellarin is an experimental antibiotic potentiator that inhibits bacterial sortase A and caseinolytic peptidase P. When used in combination with vancomycin against methicillin-resistant Staphylococcus aureus, scutellarin improves activity of the antibiotic, making it an effective adjuvant in the treatment of such infections.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
