        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3007178</IRI>
        <Literal>Nitazoxanide is a thiazolide antiparatasitic and antiviral drug that has demonstrated antibacterial activity against Helicobacter pylori. It is well tolerated and exhibits a synergistic effect with other antibiotics, such as clarithromycin.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
