        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3007187</IRI>
        <Literal>This cluster confers resistance to both vancomycin and teicoplanin by allowing restructuring of peptidoglycan precursors to end in D-Ala-D-Lac. Resistance is acquired after multiple treatments with sub-minimum inhibitory concentrations of vancomycin. Gene orientation: vanHPXRS.</Literal>
