        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3007500</IRI>
        <Literal>Imidazoles are a group of antibiotics, particularly antifungals, derived from azoles. Imidazoles include imidazole derivatives clotrimazole, ketoconazole, miconazole, econazole and oxiconazole.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
