        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3007502</IRI>
        <Literal>Micafungin is an antibiotic, particularly antifungal, derived from echinocandins. It was discovered at Fujisawa Pharmaceutical Co., Ltd. It is active against most Candida species.</Literal>
