        <Literal>Glucan synthase FKS2 is involved in the production of the fungal cell wall by the synthesis of the core component beta-1,3-glucan in Candida spp. Mutations in FKS2 have been shown to confer resistance to echinocandin antibiotic micafungin.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
