        <Literal>Upc2 is a sterol synthesis regulatory element binding protein in Candida spp. Mutations in Upc2 have been shown to confer resistance to azole antibiotics including fluconazole by upregulating ERG11 expression.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
