        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3007648</IRI>
        <Literal>PSZ-1 is a PSZ beta-lactamase found in Pantoea endophytica. The gene showed resistance to penicillins and several first-, second-and third-generation cephalosporins as well as aztreonam.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
