        <Literal>A CDA beta-lactamase was identified as a novel class C enzyme that was phylogenetically and biochemically close to the chromosome-borne beta-lactamases of the genera Enterobacter and Citrobacter.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
