        <AnnotationProperty IRI="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3007650</IRI>
        <Literal>CDA-1 was recovered from a urine sample and is intermediate or resistant to third-generation cephalosporins and carbapenems. Susceptibility testing, isoelectric focusing, and analysis of outer membrane proteins showed that AmpC beta-lactamase expression combined with porin deficiency accounted for the carbapenem resistance.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
