        <Literal>Lipoxin A4 is a Specialized Pro-resolving Mediator and has direct effects on P. aeruginosa where it reduced biofilm formation and promoted ciprofloxacin antibiotic efficacy in a static biofilm-forming system. Further studies show lipoxin A4 can help antibiotic efficacy and promote monocyte activity against established P. aeruginosa biofilm formed under hydrodynamic conditions.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
