        <Literal>Candesartan is an anti-hypertensive drug that was found to have antibacterial activity against MDR S. aureus. It was demonstrated to inhibit all tested metallo-beta-lactamases and showed an in vitro synergistic bactericidal effect with meropenem against metallo-beta-lactamases-producing bacteria. Candesartan is a metal ion chelating agent.</Literal>
