        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3007763</IRI>
        <Literal>Four antitumor-antibiotics of a new structure class, the marinomycins A-D (1-4), were isolated from the saline culture of a new group of marine actinomycetes. The structures of the marinomycins are unusual macrodiolides composed of dimeric 2-hydroxy-6-alkenyl-benzoic acid lactones with conjugated tetraene-pentahydroxy polyketide chains.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
