        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3007764</IRI>
        <Literal>Marinomycin A is a member of a new class of bis-salicylate-containing polyene macrodiolides, which have potent antibiotic activity against methicillin-resistant Staphylococcus aureus and vancomycin-resistant Enterococcus faecium.</Literal>
