        <Literal>MexVW is a multidrug efflux pump complex composed of MexV and MexW as its main components. This system operates as a central transport mechanism, associating with outer membrane proteins to expel antibiotics and toxic compounds, thereby playing a role in multidrug resistance.</Literal>
