        <Literal>MexXY is a multidrug efflux pump complex consisting of MexX and MexY as its core components. This system serves as a key transport mechanism, interacting with outer membrane proteins to expel antibiotics and toxic compounds, contributing to multidrug resistance.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
