        <Literal>Atovaquone is an antimicrobial medication for the prevention and treatment of Pneumocystis jirovecii pneumonia (PCP). It is a naphthoquinone compound having a 4-(4-chlorophenyl)cyclohexyl group at the 2-position and a hydroxy substituent at the 3-position.</Literal>
