        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009167</IRI>
        <Literal>A fungicide seed treatment for control of a range of diseases including Fusarium, Rhizoctonia and Alternaria. It has a role as an androgen antagonist, an estrogen receptor agonist and an antifungal agrochemical. It was noted as being the only fungicide still providing protection against multirestitant fungi.</Literal>
