        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009176</IRI>
        <Literal>A metabolite from Penicillium brefeldianum that exhibits a wide range of antibiotic activity, including antifungal functionality. It also has a role as a Penicillium metabolite.</Literal>
