        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009187</IRI>
        <Literal>Bromuconazole is a member of the class of oxolanes and is a foliar applied conazole fungicide for a range of crops. It is a dichlorobenzene, an organobromine compound, a member of oxolanes, a member of triazoles, a conazole fungicide and a triazole fungicide.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
